WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
South Africa occupies the southern tip of the African continent, bordering the Atlantic and Indian oceans.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mafadi peak in the Drakensberg escarpment reaches 3,450 meters as South Africa's highest summit.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Table Mountain overlooks Cape Town, recognized as a global natural wonder with flat sandstone cliffs.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Known as the Rainbow Nation, South Africa embraces eleven official languages and diverse cultures.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Culinary traditions center on Braai wood-fired barbecues and flavorful Bobotie spiced minced meat.

